时整，共有3家规划设计单位参与投标。5月23日上午，市城乡规", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201405/t20140523_261412.htm", "docreltime": "2014.05.23 11:50:00", "doctitle": "三明市城市景观风貌专项规划评标结论", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 263488, "sourcename": "市城乡规划局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201405/t20140523_261412.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201405/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 259869, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201411/t20141120_259869.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）司法局：\n　　2014年3月26日，省厅组织召开了全省社区矫正工作会议。现根据会议精神，结合我市实际，就当前做好社区矫正工作提出意见如下：\n　　一、要求加强政法部门间协作配合\n　　社区矫正是非", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201411/t20141120_259869.htm", "docreltime": "2014.04.30 14:43:00", "doctitle": "关于做好当前社区矫正工作的几点意见", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 261945, "sourcename": "市司法局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201411/t20141120_259869.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201411/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 257631, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201406/t20140620_257631.htm", "content": "\n　　三明市人民政府关于印发三明市创建\n　　国家公共文化服务体系示范区规划的通知\n　　各县（市、区）人民政府，市直有关单位：\n　　经市政府同意，现将《三明市创建国家公共文化服务体系示范区规划》印发给你们，", "docabstract": "创建国家公共文化服务体系示范区规划", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201406/t20140620_257631.htm", "docreltime": "2014.03.05 10:41:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府关于印发三明市创建国家公共文化服务体系示范区规划的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubda