各单位，各大企业：\n　　《三明市“十二五”林业发展专项规划》已经市政府同意，现印发给你们，请认真组织实施。\n　　三明市人民政府\n　　二〇一一年八月十八日\n　　三明市“十二五", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201110/t20111009_231797.htm", "docreltime": "2011.10.09 09:34:00", "doctitle": "三明市人民政府关于印发三明市“十二五”林业发展专项规划的通知(明政〔2011〕5号)", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 233873, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201110/t20111009_231797.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201110/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 230771, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/t20110901_230771.htm", "content": "\n　　5月18日，省政府正式印发实施《福建省“十二五”综合交通运输体系发展专项规划》，规划主要阐述规划期内全省综合交通运输体系发展的战略意图和工作重点，是“十二五”期间政府引导和推进福建省综合交通运输体系", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/t20110901_230771.htm", "docreltime": "2011.09.01 11:04:00", "doctitle": "我省出台“十二五”综合交通运输体系发展专项规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 232847, "sourcename": "市发改委网", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/t20110901_230771.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 230772, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/t20110901_230772.htm", "content": "\n　　日前，省政府正式印发实施《福建省“十二五”能源发展专项规划》，规划主要阐述“十二五”福建能源发展环境、指导思想和基本原则，明确发展目标、主要任务和保障措施。\n　　规划提出“十二五”我省能源发展主要", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/t20110901_230772.htm", "docreltime": "2011.09.01 11:04:00", "doctitle": "我省出台“十二五”能源发展专项规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 232848, "sourcename": "市发改委网", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/t20110901_230772.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 230770, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/t20110901_230770.htm", "content": "\n　　5月18日，省政府正式印发实施《福建省“十二五”服务业发展专项规划》，规划主要阐述了规划期内全省服务业发展的目标任务和工作重点，是“十二五”期间政府引导和推进福建省服务业发展，制定服务业发展相关政策", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/t20110901_230770.htm", "docreltime": "2011.09.01 11:03:00", "doctitle": "我省正式出台“十二五”服务业发展专项规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 232846, "sourcename": "市发改委网", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/t20110901_230770.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 230769, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/t20110901_230769.htm", "content": "\n　　海峡西岸经济区东与台湾地区一水相隔，北承长江三角洲，南接珠江三角洲，是我国沿海经济带的重要组成部分，在全国区域经济发展布局中处于重要位置，具有对台交往的独特优势。福建省在海峡西岸经济区中居主体地位", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/t20110901_230769.htm", "docreltime": "2011.09.01 11:02:00", "doctitle": "海峡西岸经济区发展规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 232845, "sourcename": "市发改委网", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/t20110901_230769.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201109/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 229873, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201107/t20110727_229873.htm", "content": "\n　　市教育局\n　　（二○一一年七月）\n　　根据省、市《中长期教育改革和发展规划纲要（2010-2020）》关于开展教育改革试点的部署，按照统筹规划，分步实施、试点先行、动态调整的原则，在部分地区和学校开展重大改", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201107/t20110727_229873.htm", "docreltime": "2011.07.27 11:33:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育改革试点总体方案", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 231949, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201107/t20110727_229873.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201107/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 227875, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201105/t20110504_227875.htm", "content": "\n　　详见附件：", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201105/t20110504_227875.htm", "docreltime": "2011.05.04 10:00:00", "doctitle": "十二五住房建设规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 229951, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201105/t20110504_227875.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "商品住房表.xls", "appdocid": 227875, "appfile": "P020160520349968804550.xls", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201105/t20110504_227875.htm", "fileext": "xls", "_src": "/protect/P0201605/P020160520/P020160520349968804550.xls", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201105/P020160520349968804550.xls"}, {"appdesc": "公共租赁住房规划表.doc", "appdocid": 227875, "appfile": "P020160520349968972824.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/201105/t20110504_227875.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/prot