: "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200905/t20090504_209460.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0201605/P020160520/P020160520004894680575.doc", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200905/P020160520004894680575.doc"}, {"appdesc": "旅游市场开拓计划.doc", "appdocid": 209460, "appfile": "P020160520004894867525.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200905/t20090504_209460.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0201605/P020160520/P020160520004894867525.doc", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200905/P020160520004894867525.doc"}, {"appdesc": "主题产品.doc", "appdocid": 209460, "appfile": "P020160520004895023822.doc", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 3, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200905/t20090504_209460.htm", "fileext": "doc", "_src": "/protect/P0201605/P020160520/P020160520004895023822.doc", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200905/P020160520004895023822.doc"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200905/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 204005, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080822_204005.htm", "content": "\n　　（2006 — 2010 年）\n　　前 言\n　　基础测绘是为国民经济和社会发展提供基础地理信息而按照国家统一的技术规范标准组织实施的测绘工作的总称，其内容包括建立统一的测绘基准和测绘系统，进行基础航空摄影，获取", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080822_204005.htm", "docreltime": "2008.08.22 15:59:00", "doctitle": "三明市“十一五”基础测绘专项规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 206080, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080822_204005.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 201185, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_201185.htm", "content": "\n　　第一章　　建设现状\n　　农业服务体系是提高农业生产力的一个重要因素。农业服务体系主要包括农业技术推广、农产品质量安全和标准、动物防疫和植物保护、认证认可等服务体系。农业的发展，需要健全的农业服务体", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_201185.htm", "docreltime": "2008.03.12 11:09:00", "doctitle": "三明市“十一五”农业和农村服务体系建设专项规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 203260, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_201185.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 199059, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_199059.htm", "content": "\n　　为进一步加快我市的科技进步，提高科技持续创新能力，实现科技的跨越式发展，增强三明经济发展的后劲，特制定《三明市“十一五”科技与高新技术产业发展专项规划》。\n　　一、发展现状与重大需求\n　　（一）科技", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_199059.htm", "docreltime": "2007.09.04 11:06:00", "doctitle": "三明市十一五科技与高新技术产业发展专项规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 201134, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_199059.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 198415, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_198415.htm", "content": "\n　　三明市经济贸易委员会\n　　（二〇〇七年六月）\n　　前 言\n　　“十五”计划实施以来，在市委市政府领导下，以邓小平理论和“三个代表”重要思想为指导，全面贯彻党的十六大和十六届三中、四中、五中全会精神，树", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_198415.htm", "docreltime": "2007.06.10 09:41:00", "doctitle": "三明市“十一五”循环经济发展与资源节约专项规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 200490, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_198415.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 198330, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_198330.htm", "content": "\n　　为进一步实施科教强市战略，加快人才资源开发，建设一支适应我市经济社会发展的人才队伍,根据市委、市政府《关于进一步加强人才工作的实施意见》、《三明市国民经济和社会发展第十一个五年规划纲要》以及上级有", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_198330.htm", "docreltime": "2007.05.29 09:51:00", "doctitle": "三明市“十一五”人才队伍建设专项规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 200405, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_198330.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 197430, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_197430.htm", "content": "\n　　市老龄委\n　　（二○○七年三月）\n　　为适应人口老龄化发展趋势，促进我市老龄事业与经济社会健康、协调发展，根据《中共中央、国务院关于加强老龄工作的决定》、《中华人民共和国老年人权益保障法》和《中国老", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_197430.htm", "docreltime": "2007.03.15 10:11:00", "doctitle": "三明市老龄事业发展“十一五”规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 199505, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_197430.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 196152, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "专项规划", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_196152.htm", "content": "\n　　为切实加强我市消防工作，创造良好的消防安全环境，根据《中华人民共和国消防法》、《福建省消防条例》、和《福建省“十一五”消防工作专项规划》等法律法规和有关文件精神，结合全市消防工作实际，制订本规划。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_196152.htm", "docreltime": "2006.10.12 09:30:00", "doctitle": "三明市“十一五”消防工作专项规划", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 198227, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/t20080823_196152.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ghjh/zxgh/200808/", "rels": []}]}